  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\r\n[Fearsome]\r\n- Khi tri\u1EC7u
    h\u1ED3i ta, gi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng minh \u0111\u1EC3 gi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t
    k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 Th\u1EA7n Tr\xF9ng \u2014 hung th\u1EA7n g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi
    n\u1ED7i s\u1EE3 tr\xF9ng tang. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi x\u01B0a tin ta tra h\u1ECFi
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi ch\u1EBFt \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1ECDi th\xEAm th\xE2n nh\xE2n
    \u0111i theo, n\xEAn c\xF3 t\u1EE5c t\xEDnh gi\u1EDD m\u1EA5t, nh\u1ED1t vong
    ho\u1EB7c g\u1EEDi vong l\xEAn ch\xF9a."
